    "name": "SYNCCOM-009: the server rate-limits with 429 and Retry-After: the client waits as told, never asks early, and still finishes",
    "description": "SYNCCOM-009 (Sync.com): certain server errors made the app retry the same operation indefinitely with no backoff. Rule E6: Retry-After honoured for 429, never asked early. sync-chaos res-429-retry-after.",
    "steps": [
      { "op": "drive_create", "remote": "r" },
